  ('L0003', 3, 'Look-alike words, different melodies', 'words', 'Two words that look almost alike and sound different, and your first full sentence.', 'SRC-AGENT:lesson', 'unverified', 'No new units or rules (owner decision 11: no class rule, no explanation of why the melodies differ). New words: ເຂົາ W000160 and ເກົ້າ W000141 (W001287 ເຂົາ ''horn'' is a homograph and is not taught). Both use only known units (C01 C02 C13 V35 T2). Recycled: ກິນ W000018 and ເຂົ້າ W000019, plus the phrase S000002870 (only two earlier words exist). Sentence S000002871 is composed and unverified.')
